      "summary": "Smart-glasses screen tracking now applies throughout DroidDeck: its menus and settings, non-Steam launchers, desktop sessions, and games share the same configuration. Users can select a tracked virtual screen without starting SteamVR. The branch also adds Luma Ultra positional tracking and optional stereo-assisted controllers, improves glasses display routing, and hardens SteamVR startup and rende",
