      "summary": "Adds an optional second Steam client: Valve's x86-64 Linux client, unchanged, running under FEX beside the default arm64 client. It is picked in Steam settings (Steam client: ARM64 / x86-64, applies next session), lives in its own home with its own game library, and shares the arm64 client's sign-in.",
