    {
      "tag": "pr-1036",
      "title": "feat: Better boot movies system; Added steamdeckrepo support",
      "summary": "\u2022 Installed: the \u201cInstalled movies\u201d row has a Browse button. It opens a list with a cover for each movie and the current one highlighted. The list re-reads every 2 seconds, so a movie picked or removed inside Steam shows up.\n\u2022 Import: the same import as before. Imported movies now go into Steam\u2019s own movies folder, so Steam lists them too.\n\u2022 SteamDeckRepo: search, device filter (all, Steam Deck, Steam Machine), and Trending / Most downloaded / Most liked / Newest tabs. Each page shows 12 movies, with Previous and Next buttons. Install downloads the movie, and the button turns into Use.\n\u2022 Sound: the on/off toggle, plus a volume slider and a \u201cLength\u201d slider. I read your \u201cseconds slide\u201d as how many seconds of the movie play, from 1 s up to the movie\u2019s full length. Tell me if you meant something else.\n\u2022 The Adjust logo hint now reads \u201cThis exact spot can differ by a few pixels.\u201d",
